function section(id,part,title,ledes,body){const n=partNumber[id];return `<section id="chapter-${n}" class="section report-part part-${id}"><div class="section-inner"><header class="part-head"><div class="part-meta"><span class="part-no">0${n}</span><span class="part-label">${text(part)}</span></div><div class="part-title"><h2>${text(title)}</h2><div class="part-ledes">${ledes.map(l=>`<p>${text(l)}</p>`).join('')}</div></div></header>${body}</div></section>`}
function questionType(type){return `<span class="badge">${text(bi(type==='single'?'单选题':'多选题',type==='single'?'Single choice':'Multiple choice'))}</span>`}
function card({cls='',id='',eyebrow='',title,type,insight='',insightLabel,body,foot='',tools=''}){return `<article class="card ${cls}"${id?` id="${id}"`:''}><header class="card-head"><div class="card-titles">${eyebrow?`<span class="eyebrow">${eyebrow}</span>`:''}<h3>${text(title)}</h3></div>${type?questionType(type):''}</header>${insight?`<div class="card-insight">${insightBlock(insight,insightLabel)}</div>`:''}${tools?`<div class="card-tools">${tools}</div>`:''}<div class="card-body">${body}</div>${foot?`<footer class="card-foot">${foot}</footer>`:''}</article>`}
const note=html=>`<p class="note"><strong>${text(bi('注意：','Note: '))}</strong>${html}</p>`;

/* ---- Pie charts (Part 1) ---- */
const blueRamp=['#bfdbfe','#93c5fd','#60a5fa','#3b82f6','#2563eb','#1d4ed8'];
function pieChart(items,ramp,rich=false){
  const total=items.reduce((a,[,v])=>a+v,0);const R=96,C=100;let a0=-Math.PI/2;
  const pt=(a,r=R)=>[C+r*Math.cos(a),C+r*Math.sin(a)];
  const slices=items.map(([label,value],i)=>{
    if(!value)return '';
    const a1=a0+value/total*2*Math.PI;const mid=(a0+a1)/2;const [x0,y0]=pt(a0),[x1,y1]=pt(a1);
    const d=`M${C} ${C}L${x0.toFixed(2)} ${y0.toFixed(2)}A${R} ${R} 0 ${a1-a0>Math.PI?1:0} 1 ${x1.toFixed(2)} ${y1.toFixed(2)}Z`;
    const [tx,ty]=pt(mid,R*.66);a0=a1;
    const localized=bi(label,labelTranslations[label]||label);
    return `<g data-slice="${i}"><path d="${d}" fill="${ramp[i]}"><title>${text(localized)}: ${value}%</title></path>${value>=7?`<text x="${tx.toFixed(1)}" y="${ty.toFixed(1)}" fill="${inkFor(ramp[i])}">${value}%</text>`:''}</g>`}).join('');
  const legend=items.map(([label,value],i)=>{const localized=bi(label,labelTranslations[label]||label);return `<li data-slice="${i}"><i style="background:${ramp[i]}"></i><span>${text(localized)}</span><strong>${value}%</strong>${rich?`<em class="pie-bar"><u style="width:${value}%;background:${ramp[i]}"></u></em>`:''}</li>`}).join('');
  return `<div class="pie-wrap${rich?' is-rich':''}"><svg class="pie" viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img">${slices}</svg><ul class="pie-legend">${legend}</ul></div>`}
function setupPies(){document.querySelectorAll('.pie-wrap').forEach(wrap=>{const nodes=[...wrap.querySelectorAll('[data-slice]')];const set=i=>nodes.forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('is-dim',i!==null&&n.dataset.slice!==i));nodes.forEach(n=>{n.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>set(n.dataset.slice));n.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>set(null))})})}

/* ---- Part 3 usage rankings ---- */
const segLabel=(long,short)=>`<span class="seg-long">${text(long)}</span><span class="seg-short">${text(short)}</span>`;
const usageSegment=()=>`<div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="${text(bi('按地区查看','Filter by region'))}"><button type="button" class="is-active" data-usage-group="all" aria-pressed="true">${text(bi('全部','All'))}<small>100</small></button><button type="button" data-usage-group="china" aria-pressed="false"><i class="dot is-china"></i>${segLabel(bi('大中华区（含港澳台）开发者','Greater China (incl. HK, MO & TW)'),bi('中国','China'))}<small>60</small></button><button type="button" data-usage-group="overseas" aria-pressed="false"><i class="dot is-overseas"></i>${segLabel(bi('海外地区开发者','Overseas developers'),bi('海外','Overseas'))}<small>40</small></button></div>`;
const usageRows=items=>items.map(([label,chinaRate,overseasRate],index)=>`<div class="u-row${index>4?' is-extra':''}"><h4>${text(label)}</h4><div class="u-bar is-china" style="--rate:${chinaRate}%"><i></i><b>${chinaRate.toFixed(1)}%</b></div><div class="u-bar is-overseas" style="--rate:${overseasRate}%"><i></i><b>${overseasRate.toFixed(1)}%</b></div></div>`).join('');
const usageToggle=extra=>extra?`<button class="more-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="show-more">${text(bi(`加载更多（后 ${extra} 项）`,`Show more (next ${extra})`))}</span><span class="show-less">${text(bi(`收起后 ${extra} 项`,`Collapse ${extra} items`))}</span></button>`:'';
function chinaUsageRanking(id,title,description,items,insight,takeaway,type='multiple'){
  const config=usageRankingConfigs[id];const value=(key,fallback)=>config&&Object.hasOwn(config,key)?config[key]:fallback;
  const resolvedItems=value('items',items);const resolvedTakeaway=value('takeaway',takeaway);const resolvedInsight=value('insight',insight);
  const extra=Math.max(0,resolvedItems.length-5);const body=`<div class="u-list">${usageRows(resolvedItems)}</div>${usageToggle(extra)}`;
  const insightHtml=text(resolvedTakeaway||resolvedInsight||bi('',''));
  return card({cls:'usage-card',id,title:value('title',title),type,insight:insightHtml,tools:usageSegment(),body}).replace('<article class="card usage-card"','<article data-group="all" class="card usage-card"')}
const q15Views=[['models','models',icons.cpu,bi('模型','Models'),bi('仅从模型维度出发，不考虑与工具 / 使用入口的组合','Consider models only, not their combinations with tools or entry points')],['tools','tools',icons.wrench,bi('工具 / 使用入口','Tools & Entry Points'),bi('仅从工具 / 使用入口维度出发，不考虑与模型的组合','Consider tools and entry points only, not their combinations with models')],['both','combinations',icons.layers,bi('工具 / 使用入口 + 模型','Tools & Entry Points + Models'),bi('从工具 / 使用入口与模型的组合维度出发','Consider combinations of tools, entry points, and models')]];
function q15Panel(kind,items,view){const visible=items.slice(0,10);const extra=Math.max(0,visible.length-5);return `<div class="q15-panel" data-q15-panel="${view}" hidden>${insightBlock(stripPrefix(text(q15Insights[kind])))}<div class="u-list">${usageRows(visible)}</div>${usageToggle(extra)}</div>`}
function q15PreferenceRanking(){
  const tabs=q15Views.map(([view,,icon,label,description])=>`<button type="button" role="tab" data-q15-view="${view}" data-q15-label="${text(label)}" aria-selected="false"><span class="tab-icon">${icon}</span><span class="tab-copy"><b>${text(label)}</b><small>${text(description)}</small></span></button>`).join('');
  const title=bi('基于实际体验，你最看好<span class="q15-choice"></span>配合 Xcode 进行研发？','Based on actual experience, which <span class="q15-choice"></span> do you rate most highly for development alongside Xcode?');
  const ctx=note(text(bi('受访者普遍拥有较长开发经验，且大部分开发者的技术栈不止于 Apple 平台；前述工具排序反映的是通用开发背景下的使用情况，而本题聚焦与 Xcode 协作的 Apple 开发场景。','Respondents generally have substantial development experience, and most work across technical stacks beyond Apple platforms. The earlier tool ranking reflects use in general development contexts, while this question focuses on Apple development alongside Xcode.')));
  const body=`${ctx}<div class="q15-tabs" role="tablist">${tabs}</div>${q15Panel('models',q15.models,'models')}${q15Panel('tools',q15.tools,'tools')}${q15Panel('combinations',q15.combinations,'both')}<div class="q15-pager"><button type="button" data-q15-step="-1">← ${text(bi('上一个维度','Previous view'))}</button><span class="q15-count"></span><button type="button" data-q15-step="1">${text(bi('下一个维度','Next view'))} →</button></div>`;
  return card({cls:'usage-card q15-card',title,type:'grouped',tools:usageSegment(),body}).replace('<article class="card usage-card q15-card"','<article data-group="all" data-q15-view="models" class="card usage-card q15-card"')}
function setupChinaUsageRankings(){
  document.querySelectorAll('.usage-card').forEach(cardEl=>{
    cardEl.querySelectorAll('.more-toggle').forEach(toggle=>toggle.addEventListener('click',()=>{const container=toggle.closest('.q15-panel')||cardEl;const expanded=!container.classList.contains('is-expanded');container.classList.toggle('is-expanded',expanded);toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(expanded))}));
    cardEl.querySelectorAll('[data-usage-group]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{cardEl.dataset.group=button.dataset.usageGroup;cardEl.querySelectorAll('[data-usage-group]').forEach(b=>{const on=b===button;b.classList.toggle('is-active',on);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(on))})}));
    if(cardEl.classList.contains('q15-card')){
      const views=q15Views.map(v=>v[0]);const choice=cardEl.querySelector('.q15-choice');
      const show=view=>{cardEl.dataset.q15View=view;const index=views.indexOf(view);cardEl.querySelectorAll('.q15-tabs [data-q15-view]').forEach(tab=>{const on=tab.dataset.q15View===view;tab.classList.toggle('is-active',on);tab.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(on))});cardEl.querySelectorAll('[data-q15-panel]').forEach(panel=>panel.hidden=panel.dataset.q15Panel!==view);choice.textContent=cardEl.querySelector(`.q15-tabs [data-q15-view="${view}"]`).dataset.q15Label;cardEl.querySelector('.q15-count').textContent=`${index+1} / ${views.length}`;cardEl.querySelector('[data-q15-step="-1"]').disabled=index===0;cardEl.querySelector('[data-q15-step="1"]').disabled=index===views.length-1};
      cardEl.querySelectorAll('.q15-tabs [data-q15-view]').forEach(tab=>tab.addEventListener('click',()=>show(tab.dataset.q15View)));
      cardEl.querySelectorAll('[data-q15-step]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>show(views[views.indexOf(cardEl.dataset.q15View)+Number(button.dataset.q15Step)])));
      show('models')}
  })}

